From: Contributors to the Eclipse Foundation
Subject: [PATCH] Include cstdint for uint64_t declarations

The protocol header declares epochTime() using uint64_t, but relies on
transitive includes to define that type. Include cstdint directly so the
header also compiles with toolchains that no longer provide it indirectly.
The shared context header also declares uint64_t fields and needs the same
explicit include.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/src/Context.h
+++ b/src/Context.h
@@ -27 +27,2 @@
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <memory>
--- a/src/Mqtt/MqttMessagingProtocolJSON.h
+++ b/src/Mqtt/MqttMessagingProtocolJSON.h
@@ -18,6 +18,8 @@
 #define SDV_SUA_MQTTMESSAGINGPROTOCOLJSON_H
 
 #include "IMqttMessagingProtocol.h"
+
+#include <cstdint>
 
 namespace sua {
 
